				<wikidot:authorName>FoolishEngineer</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5222605</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>just read this and i cant help but remember<br /> when i first heard of the foundation like two years ago, it was already long over this &quot;lolfoundation&quot; phase, and i still remember that i kept seeing everywhere &quot;please dont post lolfoundation&quot;, and i got even more confused when i looked the tag lolfoundation. and it took me months to even find the older articles in which every doctor ever was some sort of troubled dysfunctional self insert, the d class were like disposable toys for the amusement of the doctors, the scp's were really op and very derivative and included an awful lot of pop culture jokes and were almost entirely either a bunch of super funny euclid humanoids that just walked around unchecked, or cursed porcelain items that you find at aunt emma's house forgotten in a box labeled &quot;jezebel&quot;, the foundation was essentially one of those old, dusty office environments in which everyone was bored to death so everyone kept playing super/preter/antinatural pranks, murdering for kicks, or having sex disregarding proffesional <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">and ethical</span> issues, the o5's were just corrupt figureheads obsessed with immortality who happened to have made their names expunged from existence, everything ever was censored, the goi's were really all over the place, you all know it<br /> i love looking back and seeing where the great foundation came from<br /> i love this</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
